Package: estilex
Title: Access Estonian Legislation from the 'Riigi Teataja'
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Kristian", "Vepsäläinen", , "kristian.vepsalainen@proton.me",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Retrieves consolidated texts of Estonian acts and regulations
    from the public interface of the 'Riigi Teataja', Estonia's official
    legal gazette <https://www.riigiteataja.ee>. Returns document metadata,
    text rendered with its chapter and section structure intact, amendment
    histories at both act and section level, and English translations
    aligned section by section with the Estonian original, which makes
    translation fidelity measurable. Identifiers can also be enumerated
    from the published open data archives.
